[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m The real part of this expression is \(324\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta\). To maximize this, we need to find the maximum value of the expression \(324\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta\). This can be done by expressing it in the form \(R\cos(\theta + \phi)\), where \(R = \sqrt{324^2 + 468^2}\):
