[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m The maximum value of \(R\cos(\theta + \phi)\) is \(R\), which is \(360\sqrt{2}\). Therefore, the maximum value of the real part of the expression is \(360\sqrt{2}\).
