[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m [response] To solve the problem, we need to maximize the real part of the expression \((75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z}\) where \(|z| = 4\). Let's represent \(z\) in its polar form as \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m Substituting \(z = 4e^{i\theta}\) into the expression, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m (75 + 117i)z = (75 + 117i)4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) = 4(75\cos\theta + 117i\cos\theta + 75i\sin\theta - 117\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(117\cos\theta + 75\sin\theta))
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + 4i(117\cos\theta + 75\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m And,
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} \cdot \frac{\cos\theta - i\sin\theta}{\cos^2\theta + \sin^2\theta} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} (\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m = (24 + 36i)(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta) = 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta + i(-24\sin\theta + 36\cos\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m Combining these, the expression becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + 4i(117\cos\theta + 75\sin\theta) + 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta + i(-24\sin\theta + 36\cos\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m = (4 \cdot 75\cos\theta - 4 \cdot 117\sin\theta + 24\cos\theta) + i(4 \cdot 117\cos\theta + 4 \cdot 75\sin\theta - 24\sin\theta + 36\cos\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m \[
