[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m = (324\cos\theta - 468\sin\theta) + i(504\cos\theta + 276\sin\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m The real part of the expression is:
