[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=508551)[0m To maximize this expression, we can use the method of Lagrange multipliers or recognize that the maximum value of \(a\cos\theta - b\sin\theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\). Here, \(a = 324\) and \(b = 468\), so the maximum value is:
